<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-phase-1-bis" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents the best overall gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic Phase 1. This comprehensive setup includes items from all three raids (Mogu'Shan Vaults, Heart of Fear, and Terrace of Endless Spring) as well as reputation rewards and world bosses. Marksmanship Hunters should prioritize Agility-heavy pieces with Critical Strike and Mastery/<wbr/>Haste Rating to maximize the value of reforging.<br/>
