<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Marksmanship Hunters in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The set bonuses available in Phase 1 are fantastic, providing significant damage increases and utility for Marksmanship Hunters. The Tier 14 set bonuses enhance our core abilities and provide substantial DPS gains through a haste bonus and damage multipliers. These bonuses are essential for maximizing your performance in raid encounters and should be prioritized when gearing up.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-14">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Tier 14 - <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item-set=1129/yaungol-slayer-battlegear">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Yaungol Slayer Battlegear</span></a></span></h3>
