<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c3" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Reputation for Marksmanship Hunters in Phase 1</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first. As a Marksmanship Hunter, we recommend you prioritize <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1269/golden-lotus">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Golden Lotus</span></a> to get your hands on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89344/windwalker-spaulders">
